        "description": "Classify raw offset: missing -> {kind:\"missing\",offset:null}; explicit null -> {kind:\"null\",offset:null}; exact integer 2..11 -> {kind:\"integer\",offset:original}; other -> {kind:\"invalid\",offset:null}. No bool/float/coercion/defaults/exceptions. Helper receives the mapping, is invoked at module scope and its returned object is assigned to result. Target typed inputs interface requires selected-runner support; unapproved draft, not submitted or activated.",
